# Squawkroaster: "Double strike. Vivid - Squawkroaster's power is equal to the number of colors among permanents you control."
# With only itself in play (Black Lotus and the lands are colorless) it is 1/4 (CR 105.2, 604.3); once Bot1 also controls a green
# Llanowar Elves it is 2/4 - the toughness is printed. Bot2's white Glorious Anthem is not a permanent Bot1 controls, so it adds
# no color. It attacks as double strike (CR 702.4): two hits of 2 is 4 damage.

